test('任务进度询问仅主人可用并支持编号',()=>{const c={...config(),mode:'reply'};const q=event({message:[{type:'text',data:{text:'任务编号 abcd 进度怎么样'}}]});assert.deepEqual(progressQuery(q,c),{id:'abcd'});assert.equal(progressQuery({...q,user_id:23456789},c),null);assert.deepEqual(progressQuery(event({message:[{type:'text',data:{text:'现在任务进度怎么样'}}]}),c),{id:''});assert.equal(progressQuery(event({message:[{type:'text',data:{text:'进度 abcd'}}]}),c).id,'abcd');});
test('私信任务审批只接受主人明确决定，群聊转发不能批准',()=>{const c={...config(),mode:'reply'};const e=event({message:[{type:'text',data:{text:'同意 abcd'}}]});assert.deepEqual(privateApproval(e,c),{allow:true,id:'abcd'});assert.equal(privateApproval({...e,user_id:23456789},c),null);assert.equal(privateApproval({...e,message_type:'group'},c),null);assert.equal(privateApproval({...e,message:[{type:'text',data:{text:'他说同意'}}]},c),null);assert.equal(privateApproval({...e,message:[{type:'text',data:{text:'不同意'}}]},c).allow,false);});
test('表情管理删除仅索引且不会修改其他分区同名项',()=>{const root=fs.mkdtempSync(path.join(os.tmpdir(),'emoji-management-'));const a=new QQActions(root,{value:config()},async()=>{});a.items=[{scope:'group:11111',name:'猫',hash:'a'.repeat(64)},{scope:'group:22222',name:'猫',hash:'a'.repeat(64)}];a.manage({scope:'group:11111',name:'猫',action:'rename',newName:'新猫'});assert.equal(a.items[1].name,'猫');a.manage({scope:'group:11111',name:'新猫',action:'delete'});assert.equal(a.items.length,1);assert.throws(()=>a.manage({scope:'group:22222',name:'猫',action:'rename',newName:''}));});
