test('QQ任务管理仅主人且编号不允许歧义',()=>{const c={...config(),mode:'reply'};const r=taskCommand(event({message:[{type:'text',data:{text:'/指导 abc 检查已有文件'}}]}),c);assert.equal(r.id,'abc');assert.equal(r.text,'检查已有文件');assert.equal(taskCommand(event({user_id:23456789,message:[{type:'text',data:{text:'/继续 abc'}}]}),c),null);assert.throws(()=>selectTask([{id:'abc1',owner:c.ownerQQ},{id:'abc2',owner:c.ownerQQ}],'abc',c.ownerQQ));});
test('撤回只允许当前分区机器人消息，普通人不能撤回他人回复',async()=>{const root=fs.mkdtempSync(path.join(os.tmpdir(),'nikolink-qq-actions-'));const c={...config(),mode:'reply'};const calls=[];const store={value:{...c,seen:[]},save(){}};const actions=new QQActions(root,store,async(a,b)=>{calls.push(a);return {};});actions.track({key:'private:'+c.ownerQQ,user:c.ownerQQ},{message_id:10});await actions.receive(event({message_id:20,message:[{type:'reply',data:{id:'10'}},{type:'text',data:{text:'撤回'}}]}));assert.ok(calls.includes('delete_msg'));});
test('继续任务保留会话与投递标记并重置15分钟时限',async()=>{const root=fs.mkdtempSync(path.join(os.tmpdir(),'nikolink-resume-'));const c={...config(),mode:'reply'};const tasks=new OwnerTasks(root,{value:c});const workspace=path.join(root,'workspace');const resultDir=path.join(workspace,'task');fs.mkdirSync(resultDir,{recursive:true});const t={id:'task',owner:c.ownerQQ,status:'timed_out',sessionID:'original',resultDir,text:'下载文件',deliveryAttempts:{file:'attempted'}};tasks.items=[t];const calls=[];tasks.host={ready:true,workspace,stop(){},call:async(url,body)=>{calls.push({url,body});if(url.endsWith('/original'))return {data:{agent:'owner-task',location:{directory:workspace}}};if(url.endsWith('/permission'))return {data:[]};if(url.includes('/message'))return {data:[{id:'old-idle',type:'idle',outcome:'interrupted'}]};return {data:{}};}};try{await tasks.resume('task');assert.equal(t.status,'running');assert.equal(t.sessionID,'original');assert.equal(t.deliveryAttempts.file,'attempted');assert.equal(t.runExpiresAt-t.startedAt,900000);assert.deepEqual(t.resumeBaseline,['old-idle']);assert.ok(calls.some(v=>v.url.endsWith('/prompt')));await assert.rejects(tasks.resume('task'));}finally{tasks.stop();}});
test('继续任务不能绕过暂停或主人身份校验',async()=>{const root=fs.mkdtempSync(path.join(os.tmpdir(),'nikolink-resume-deny-'));const c={...config(),mode:'paused'};const tasks=new OwnerTasks(root,{value:c});tasks.items=[{id:'task',owner:c.ownerQQ,status:'cancelled',sessionID:'original'}];await assert.rejects(tasks.resume('task'));c.mode='reply';c.ownerQQ='99999999';await assert.rejects(tasks.resume('task'));tasks.stop();});
